<title>JAPAN: Russia to send platinum to Japan by Monday-traders.</title>
<headline>Russia to send platinum to Japan by Monday-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Almazjuvelierexport, the state metals export agency, plans to send platinum to Japan for arrival by Monday, metal traders in Tokyo said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect platinum to arrive on Monday,&quot; said one trader, adding his company received an invoice from Almazjuvelierexport late on Thursday.</p>
<p>Another trader said his company had also received an invoice from Moscow, adding he expected platinum, spot palladium and rhodium to arrive over the weekend.</p>
</text>
